Package: chiptools
Type: Package
Title: Miscellaneous ChIP-seq and RNA-seq Processing Functions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("James", "Purzner", email = "jpurzner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Analysis helpers accumulated across the GNP/MB cerebellar
    ChIP-seq and RNA-seq work: mixture-model thresholding of binding signal,
    upper-tail trimming and segmentation of histone-mark intensities,
    differential-binding wrappers around DESeq2, count normalisation
    (RPM/RPKM/TPM), time-course interpolation and half-max timing, GO
    enrichment wrappers around topGO, and the t-SNE, cluster-line and
    timeline figures built on top of them. Most functions take a features x
    samples data frame and are meant to be composed at the console rather
    than run as a pipeline.
